<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 10.6 pct yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 10.6 pct yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 10.6 percent year on year in May against revised 11.1 percent growth in April, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.89 trillion baht in May from 3.87 trillion in April.</p>
<p>    M-2			  May 97	 April 97	 May 96</p>
<p>    Money supply		3.89	    3.87	    3.51</p>
<p>    Percentage change	10.6	    11.1	    19.2</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said the May figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
